urce src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/c4ebbec1dd3f50d033aef6fbd1a63a61.mp4?t=1787826748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Just make sure to be back before midnight. <br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Drain - Roadmap</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/5d132818484315f0f5c572adf21a16fc.avif?t=1787826748\" width=1170 height=1073 /></span>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night-Time</strong>, Feed your master in a difficult small arena battler setting.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daytime</strong>, Scavenge, Prepare and explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock</strong> new weapons, body parts and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a world heavily inspired by <strong>90s campy horror</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beware of the noise</strong> you make.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything is as it seems.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About us:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re a small, passionate two-man team that has been working hard for over 3 years to bring this game to life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magnus the artist:</strong> Leading the project, does the visuals, sound fx and gameplay side of things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Björn the programmer:</strong> Makes it all run with… dark magic?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our Vision</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Drain</i> is meant to be a <strong>hard,</strong> this is not a straight hack and slash, it's more of a delicate stab in the dark. It’s <strong>challenging, bloody, and unforgiving</strong>, but every victory is earned.<br> <br> <br>  <br>Your task has already begun. <strong>The Drain commands you. </strong>Wishlist now, or join our Early Access!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
